OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fsunshine and scattered showers on
OL,7,FSunday, most frequent in the west.
OL,8,FMild and windy with rain on Monday,
OL,9,Fbut drier in the east. Bright with a
OL,10,Ffew showers Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
